AB  - With the construction and development of smart grid, the traditional power information system operation architecture is facing the pressure brought by the rapid growth of company business and the rapid development of information technology. In the process of information system lifecycle management, there are some problems, such as unclear division of responsibilities, long system construction time, high risk of system upgrade, etc. In order to solve the existing problems, this paper introduces and analyzes the DevOps engineering thought and technology which takes the development and operation and maintenance of information system as a whole, and studies the application model of DevOps in the current power information system management process. In recent years, with the development of machine learning and deep learning, artificial neural network algorithms have made breakthroughs in different fields, and various network mechanisms and training algorithms have emerged. For example, in the field of load forecasting, there are methods based on probability forecasting and so on. Therefore, it is of great significance to study the application of the new algorithm in the power system to improve the accuracy of power load forecasting and improve the reliability of power network operation. By studying the application model based on DevOps in the whole life cycle process of the power information system, it provides a research basis for the development of the power information system operation structure, and promotes the management of the information system to continuously meet the requirements of lean management and meet the needs of the company's business development.
