T1  - Navigating the DevOps landscape
AU  - Zhang, Xinrui
AU  - Zhao, Pincan
AU  - Jaskolka, Jason
JO  - Journal of Systems and Software
VL  - 223
SP  - 112331
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/05/01/
SN  - 0164-1212
